20 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt (Two line graphs display mangrove area in hectares over time from July 2019 to January 2024. Graph \(a\) compares multiple models including Unet+SE+CBAM, CONVLSTM+ECO, and others, showing varied trends. Graph \(b\) shows Unet+SE+CBAM, LSTM, and RNN models. Unet+SE+CBAM depicts a fluctuating increase, while LSTM and RNN show more stable trends. Both graphs label time on the x-axis and mangrove area on the y-axis, with a legend for model identification.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 37 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
21 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Graph showing the mangrove area in hectares from 1993 to 2023 and predictions for 2024-2026. The left chart shows historical data with a general increase over time. The right chart depicts predictions: U-Net + ConvLSTM reaching 710.5 hectares, ConvLSTM + ECOLOSS at 701.4 hectares, and ConvLSTM at 710.2 hectares. Different colored lines represent each prediction model.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
